From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:59:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] include: all of Windows.Web.Http, Headers and Filters.

windows.web.http.idl now declares the three namespaces whole, generated
from Windows.Web.winmd by the outer repository's scripts/winmd-idl.py:
every class, interface, enum and generic instance they use, the
headers' value and collection classes among them.  They refer to each
other's types, so they share the one file; windows.web.http.filters.idl
and the new windows.web.http.headers.idl import it under their names.

With them, the parts of other namespaces they need:
Windows.Security.Cryptography.Certificates, generated from
Windows.Security.winmd; PasswordCredential in
Windows.Security.Credentials; SocketSslErrorSeverity in
Windows.Networking.Sockets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 1b2bacd18f607d7fa00958482e868f1ce9099809)

